* LT3094 Negative LDO: -7 V IN  ->  -5.0 V OUT
* ----------------------------------------------------------------
* Vout = -50uA * Rset  =>  Rset = 100k for -5.0 V
* ----------------------------------------------------------------

* --- Model library for the genuine LT3094 macromodel ---
.include LT3094.lib

* --- Negative input supply (soft ramp to aid start-up) ---
V1 IN 0 PWL(0 0 500u -7 10m -7)

* --- Input / output capacitors ---
CIN  IN  0 1u
COUT OUT 0 10u

* --- Light resistive load: -5 V / 1k = 5 mA ---
RL OUT 0 1k

* --- Output voltage programming resistor (SET pin to GND) ---
RSET SET 0 100k

* --- Power-good pull-down (PG is open collector, unused here) ---
RPG PG 0 100k

* --- LT3094 negative LDO ---
* pin order: IN  OUT  OUTS  SET  ILIM  EN/UV  PGFB  PG  GND
XU1 IN OUT OUT SET ILIM IN 0 PG 0 LT3094

* --- Analysis ---
.tran 0 10m 0 5u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM=8m TO=10m
.meas TRAN vout_final FIND V(OUT) AT=10m

.options plotwinsize=0 gmin=1e-12 reltol=1e-4

.end
